G0862.def:
ἄ-φθαρτος, -ον
(φθείρω), [in LXX: Wis.12:1 18:4 * ;] 
imperishable, immortal; 
__(a) of things: 1 Corinthiens 9:25, 1 Pierre 1:4 1:23 3:4; 
__(b) of persons: of men, 1 Corinthiens 15:52; of God, Romains 1:23, 1 Timothée 1:17 (MM, see word).†

G0891.def:
ἄχρι
(and Epic ἄχρις, bef. vowel (see MM, see word), Romains 11:25 T, Galates 3:19 T, WH, mg., Hébreux 3:13); 
__1. adv., utterly (Hom.). 
__2. Prep. with genitive, until, unto, as far as; 
__(a) of time Actes 3:21 22:22, Romains 1:13 5:13, 1 Corinthiens 4:11, 2 Corinthiens 3:14, Galates 4:2, Philippiens 1:6; ἄ. καιροῦ, Luc 4:13, Actes 13:11; ἄ. ἧς ἡμέρας, Matthieu 24:38, Luc 1:20 17:27, Actes 1:2 (τῆς ἡ. ἧς), Actes 1:22; ἄ. ταύτης τ. ἡμέρας (τ. ἡ. ταύτης), Actes 2:29 23:1 26:22; ἄ. ἡμερων πέντε, Actes 20:6; ἄ. αὐγῆς, Actes 20:11; ἄ. τοῦ νῦν, Romains 8:22, Philippiens 1:5; ἄ. τέλους, Hébreux 6:11, Apocalypse 2:26; 
__(b) of space: Actes 11:5 13:6 20:4 (R, txt., WH, mg.) Actes 28:15, 2 Corinthiens 10:13-14, Hébreux 4:12, Apocalypse 14:20 18:5; 
__(with) of measure or degree: ἄ. θανάτου, Actes 22:4, Apocalypse 2:10 12:11. 
__3. As conj., until; 
__(a) ἄχρι alone: with subj. aor., Galates 3:19 (ἄ. οὗ T, WH, mg.); id. without ἄν (Bl., § 65, 10), Apocalypse 7:3 15:8 20:3, 5; with indic. fut., Apocalypse 17:17; 
__(b) ἄ. οὗ (i.e. ἄ.. τούτου ᾧ): with indic. aor., Actes 7:18; impf., Actes 27:33; with subj. aor. (Bl., ut supr.), Luc 21:24, Romains 11:25, 1 Corinthiens 11:26 15:25, Galates 3:19, T, WH, mg.; id. with ἄν, Apocalypse 2:25; with indic. pres., while, Hébreux 3:13 (cf. μέχρι).†
